[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698275794","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103283#issuecomment-2698275794","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103283","id":2698275794,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g1GvS","user":{"login":"mashumafi","id":1059099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTkwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1059099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi","html_url":"https://github.com/mashumafi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T16:36:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T16:38:45Z","body":"> I suggest adding a getter for compression_level and exposing it as a property, so you can write ZIPPacker.compression_level = ....\r\n\r\n@Calinou \r\n\r\nWould it be worth exposing `compression_level` as a `int` instead of `enum`. I think having the `enum` is nice so users have. some reference but maybe they might want to use a direct compression number as well? We can avoid the `switch` statement which would be nice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698275794/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698325546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103283#issuecomment-2698325546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103283","id":2698325546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g1S4q","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T16:53:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T16:54:15Z","body":"> Would it be worth exposing compression_level as a int instead of enum. I think having the enum is nice so users have. some reference but maybe they might want to use a direct compression number as well? We can avoid the switch statement which would be nice.\r\n\r\nThat makes sense, yes. We should probably keep some constants around for the default value (`-1`) and no compression (`0`) still.\r\n\r\nI originally had the concern we might want to change the underlying compression algorithm in the future (and therefore the meaning of the compression level). However, since this is ZIP and DEFLATE is the only universally supported compression method in ZIP, it's fair to assume it won't change anytime soon.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698325546/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698415545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103283#issuecomment-2698415545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103283","id":2698415545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g1o25","user":{"login":"mashumafi","id":1059099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTkwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1059099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi","html_url":"https://github.com/mashumafi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T17:30:13Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T17:39:01Z","body":"Thanks for the feedback! 4 changes since last review:\r\n* Renamed `COMPRESSION_BEST_SPEED` to `COMPRESSION_FAST`\r\n* `ZIPPacker::compression_level` property, which is an `int`, `enum ZIPPacker::CompressionLevel` still exists for reference\r\n* `ZIPPacker::CompressionLevel` enum uses values directly from `Z_*` compression levels, no conversion needed when using it\r\n* `ZIPReader::get_compression_level` exposed with a test to confirm it returns correctly, which works similar to `file_exists` but strictly meant to determine the compression level used. Could be useful for validation of compression levels if someone needs it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698415545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711862607","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103283#issuecomment-2711862607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103283","id":2711862607,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ho71P","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T21:17:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T21:17:32Z","body":"**Updated testing project:** [test_zip_compression_level_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19170743/test_zip_compression_level_2.zip)\r\n\r\nFile sizes for each compression level:\r\n\r\n```\r\n11,001,796 archive0.zip\r\n    53,473 archive1.zip\r\n    53,473 archive2.zip\r\n    53,473 archive3.zip\r\n    21,494 archive4.zip\r\n    21,494 archive5.zip\r\n    21,494 archive7.zip\r\n    21,494 archive8.zip\r\n    21,494 archive9.zip\r\n```\r\n\r\nUsing a compression level outside the allowed range (e.g. `-2` or `10`) will result in a 61-byte ZIP archive that can't be opened. This should print an error instead.\r\n\r\nPS: Interestingly, using the `file` command on archives created with all compression levels will always says that the compression method is Deflate, even for the one that only contains files with level 0 compression (Store):\r\n\r\n```\r\narchive-2.zip: Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive0.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive-1.zip: Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive1.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive2.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive3.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive4.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive5.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive7.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive8.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive9.zip:  Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\narchive10.zip: Zip archive data, at least v2.0 to extract, compression method=deflate\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711862607/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"c